EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yo! Nice to meet you!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}I know we just met for the first
time, but I'm moving out tomorrow!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Don't worry, though! Time doesn't
affect the depth of our friendship!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Hope to see you again!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Hola! ¡Encantado de conocerte!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Soy {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Sé que esta es la primera vez que
nos vemos, ¡pero resulta que voy
a marcharme del pueblo mañana!
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}¡Pero no te preocupes! Quién sabe,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡quizá algún día volvamos a vernos!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Piacere di conoscerti!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Io mi chiamo {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Sei passat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} di qua giusto in tempo,
domani non mi avresti trovato:
me ne vado!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Non preoccuparti. La distanza
non rovinerà la nostra amicizia!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Spero di rivederti presto.

EN:
Yo! Did you come to visit me?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Just so you know{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}this room isn't
filled with cardboard furniture, OK?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'll be moving out tomorrow, so
I'm packing up all my stuff!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}It may be a bit weird to hear this
from somebody who's moving out,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}but {{TAG:0005:0005:}} is a really nice town!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}You should stay here as long as you
can!

{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Yup! Thanks for your support!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
If you see me around, don't be a
stranger!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Sí! ¡Gracias por tu apoyo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Si me ves por ahí, ¡acércate
a hablar conmigo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Grazie, ne avrò bisogno!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Magari un giorno ci rivedremo,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Vielen Dank für die warmen Worte!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Vielleicht können wir ja irgendwann
mal zusammen joggen gehen!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Sí! ¡Gracias! ¡Haré lo posible
